'' A SHARED POINTER INITIALISED WITH A NONZERO CONSTANT ADDRESS -- 'cptr( any ptr, 15 )' -- is an inttoptr constant (fbc's dim/global-init.bas); tiko wrote 'ptr 15' and clang refused the module. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
